msgid "<b>Pagebard {version}</b><br>Reads PDFs aloud, without internet.<br><br>Free software, licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later.<br>Uses Piper voices, PyMuPDF (MuPDF and Tesseract) and Qt."
msgstr "<b>Pagebard {version}</b><br>Lee PDF en voz alta, sin internet.<br><br>Software libre, licencia AGPL-3.0-or-later.<br>Usa las voces de Piper, PyMuPDF (MuPDF y Tesseract) y Qt."

